<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Albertson's Inc started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Albertson's Inc started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Meredith Adler initiated coverage of Albertson's Inc with a neutral rating and a one-year price target $38.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We think the timing of an earnings turnaround ... is uncertain since the company is dependent on an improvement in sales to drive its growth,&quot; Adler said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 34-3/4 in midmorning exchange trading.</p>
</text>
